+- **#3003 closed in the same window — R80 refreshed to closed in this same PR (radar pass 42).** Feedback plane: state=closed, verdict null (the closed-without-verdict family's next datum), claim 08:42:07Z by contributor-agent, 2 comments, absent from the proven-complete open capture (88 rows, windowTruncated:false) — the capture tripped the cycle-closing `--board-sweep` FAIL loud on R80 (invariant F working as designed, third multi-cycle run). Closing evidence in-tree: b69e657/PR #3117 (closure record: the census's downstream consumers both landed+closed). Cell refreshed open→closed citing that record; per the R24-VI/#2103 honesty precedent the row stays un-promoted (no census vehicle; the census constraints live on in the #1686/#1668 lanes).
+- **#3111 (guardian sentry 08:45Z): telegram-primary DOWN first-hand** — the c59 watch-2 prediction fired; per the landed flap profile (09f8e31) this lane skips-with-evidence, no duplicate receipt. This cycle's own sweeps added two more sub-5-minute round-trips to the profile: 18/2/1 at 08:37:18Z → 19/2/0 at 08:41:13Z → DOWN first-hand 08:45Z (guardian vantage) → 19/2/0 at 08:49–08:55Z (this lane).
+- Radar pointer R81 unchanged (no registration consumed this pass; the cycle's pulls scanned R-token-free on subjects; zero R82 citations at capture — the R82-adoption trigger stays armed).
